---
source: tests/sync/write_cargo_toml.rs
expression: "apply(cargo, &patch)"
---
## Input

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"

[workspace]
members = ["a"]

[profile.release]
lto = true
```

## Patch

```
deps:
  - anyhow@1
```

## Output

```toml
[package]
name = "x"
version = "0.1"

[workspace]
members = ["a"]

[profile.release]
lto = true

[dependencies]
anyhow = { version = "1" }
```
